escribe the flag. Check: `bash $S --help | rg -c -- '--quiet'` prints `1` and `rg -n '^#   --quiet' $S` prints one line.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:docs -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:file-org -->\n## File Organization\n\n- [ ] CHK-050 [P1] Baselines and any temporary output live under `scratch/` only. Check: `ls $P/scratch` lists `baseline-default.txt` and `baseline-json.txt` and nothing outside the packet changed.\n- [ ] CHK-051 [P1] `scratch/` is cleaned before completion. Check: `ls $P/scratch` holds only `.gitkeep` and the two baselines the plan names.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:file-org -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:summary -->\n## Verification Summary\n\n| Category | Total | Verified |\n|----------|-------|----------|\n| P0 Items | 15 | [ ]/15 |\n| P1 Items | 16 | [ ]/16 |\n| P2 Items | 0 | [ ]/0 |\n\n**Verification Date**: 2026-10-25\n<!-- /ANCHOR:summary -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:arch-verify -->\n## L3+: Architecture Verification\n\n- [ ] CHK-100 [P0] The architecture decision is recorded. Check: `rg -n '^### ADR-001' plan.md` prints one line.\n- [ ] CHK-101 [P1] The ADR carries a status. Check: `rg -n '^\\*\\*Status\\*\\*: Proposed' plan.md` prints one line.\n- [ ] CHK-102 [P1] Alternatives are documented with a rejection reason. Check: `rg -n '^\\*\\*Alternatives Rejected\\*\\*' plan.md` prints one line.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:arch-verify -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:perf-verify -->\n## L3+: Performance Verification\n\n- [ ] CHK-110 [P1] The quiet path adds no measurable cost (NFR-P01). Check: a quiet run completes within the same second as the default run on the same input.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:perf-verify -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:docs-verify -->\n## L3+: Documentation Verification\n\n- [ ] CHK-140 [P1] All spec documents are synchronized. Check: `bash .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/validate.sh $P --strict` prints `RESULT: PASSED`.\n- [ ] CHK-141 [P1] The help text and the header block agree on the flag's contract. Check: both name \"only the recommended-level line\" as the behavior.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:docs-verify -->\n\n---\n\n","_meta":{"cognition.ai/linesAdded":2,"cognition.ai/linesRemoved":2}}],"locations":[{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/223-deepseek-final/specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/tasks.md"}],"rawInput":{"file_path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/223-deepseek-final/specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/tasks.md"},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"edit"}}
